    {
      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "The new deleteMany filter uses OR, so any WorkflowReminder with retryCount > 1 is deleted even if it is not an SMS reminder or its scheduledDate is still in the future. The previous behavior only deleted past-due SMS reminders, and the rest of the handler still processes only SMS reminders. This broadens destructive cleanup beyond the intended SMS retry limit and can remove unrelated reminders.",
